{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me carefully analyze this puzzle.\n\n**Key constraints:**\n1. Book A: contender for an award, translated into 25+ languages\n2. The award itself was created in the 2000s\n3. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won that same award\n4. Book B had been released the preceding year\n5. Author of Book B was born in the same city where Author of Book A grew up\n6. Question: where was Author of Book A born?\n\n**Analysis:** The award created in the 2000s = International Booker Prize (established 2005). From e1, Chigozie Obioma's novels were \"shortlisted for The Booker Prize and have been translated into 30 languages\" — but the Booker Prize was created in 1969, not the 2000s. So the award must be the International Booker Prize.\n\nLet me verify the International Booker Prize creation date and find which book was a contender, published in the 2010s, translated into 25+ languages.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d65\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_7613bce5db014bfe8320c5a3","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize established 2005 created history\", \"International Booker Prize 2018 winner Flights Tokarczuk published 2017\", \"International Booker Prize shortlist contender translated 25 languages 2010s\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_4a537b9fa9034f8fba621ce3","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789475100,"id":"chatcmpl-902974f3-d639-9e7a-8dc7-a39e17ac6ec6","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20755,"completion_tokens":298,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":21053,"cached_tokens":1024,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1024},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}